---
// BeP02PagesOfTwelve: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2l">
  <div class="bep2l-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 224" role="img" aria-label="Twelve cases split into pages of five. Page 1 has offset 0 and holds cases 1 to 5. Page 2 has offset 5 and holds cases 6 to 10. Page 3 has offset 10 and holds only cases 11 and 12; a short page means the end of the list.">
<text x="20" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>twelve cases, five at a time (limit=5)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mười hai vụ, mỗi lần năm vụ (limit=5)</tspan></text>
<rect x="60" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="90.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">1</text>
<rect x="124" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="154.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">2</text>
<rect x="188" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="218.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">3</text>
<rect x="252" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="282.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">4</text>
<rect x="316" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="346.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">5</text>
<rect x="380" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="410.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">6</text>
<rect x="444" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="474.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">7</text>
<rect x="508" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="538.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">8</text>
<rect x="572" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="602.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">9</text>
<rect x="636" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="666.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">10</text>
<rect x="700" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="boxr" />
<text x="730.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">11</text>
<rect x="764" y="44" width="60" height="48" rx="8" class="boxr" />
<text x="794.0" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bb">12</text>
<path d="M 60 106 L 60 114 L 376 114 L 376 106" class="ln" />
<text x="218.0" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>page 1 · offset=0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trang 1 · offset=0</tspan></text>
<text x="218.0" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>5 cases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5 vụ</tspan></text>
<path d="M 380 106 L 380 114 L 696 114 L 696 106" class="ln" />
<text x="538.0" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>page 2 · offset=5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trang 2 · offset=5</tspan></text>
<text x="538.0" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>5 cases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5 vụ</tspan></text>
<path d="M 700 106 L 700 114 L 824 114 L 824 106" class="lnr" />
<text x="824" y="138" text-anchor="end" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>page 3 · offset=10</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trang 3 · offset=10</tspan></text>
<text x="838" y="160" text-anchor="end" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>2 cases — the short page is the end</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 vụ — trang ngắn là điểm dừng</tspan></text>
<text x="450" y="206" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>page N starts at offset = (N − 1) × limit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trang N bắt đầu ở offset = (N − 1) × limit</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Offset pagination is just skip-and-take arithmetic: the third page comes up short, and that is how the client knows the list has ended.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phân trang offset chỉ là phép tính bỏ qua rồi lấy: trang thứ ba ngắn hơn, và đó là cách client biết danh sách đã hết.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2l { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2l-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2l svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2l text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2l .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep2l .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep2l .bb { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2l .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2l .f { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep2l .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2l .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2l .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2l .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2l .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2l .d { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep2l .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2l .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2l .xr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2l .ok { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2l .band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2l .bandr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2l .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2l .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2l figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
